  "content": {
    "title": "首届全国高校创业指导课程教学大赛工作推进会在延吉市召开",
    "source": "",
    "publishDate": "2013-07-13",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                        <div class=\"mainlist bor\">\n            <h5>\n                <div class=\"ttt text20\">\n                    就业动态</div>\n            </h5>\n            <div>\n                <div class=\"titles\">\n                    <span id=\"lblTitle\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><b><font size=\"5\">首届全国高校创业指导课程教学大赛工作推进会在延吉市召开</font></b></span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"xian2\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"Issues\">\n                    <span id=\"lblIssue\" style=\"display:inline-block;\"><font size=\"3\">发布部门:培训部   发布时间:2013-7-13 0:00:00</font></span>\n                </div>\n               <div id=\"tdNewsContent\"><p>&nbsp;</p> <p><font size=\"4\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7月9日下午，首届全国高校创业指导课程教学大赛工作推进暨大学生创业实训系统培训会在延吉市召开。来自全国24个省、市、区就业部门负责人和工作人员参加会议。会议由全国高等学校学生信息咨询与就业指导中心副处长周国良主持，全国中心方伟处长对前段报名工作进行总结，对下一阶段工作进行了安排部署。省高校毕业生就业指导中心主任郑志宏、书记朱军出席会议。会上，吉林、广东、安徽、江西四个省市做了经验介绍和典型发言。华普亿方软件科技有限公司对与会人员进行了培训。会议还就赛事工作和相关就业创业课程体系建设进行了座谈讨论。</font></p> <p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"migration-resource://3fcb71f0148442fb3878d66607ea5ac12a19ee69c8b1699ac392a717375b8b9a\"></p> <p align=\"center\"><strong>方伟（右三）、郑志宏（右二）、周国良（右一）、付鹏（左二）、朱军（左一）</strong></p> <p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"migration-resource://c97e7ed3cd4af56071ec482122b059d2726c405582f47f22bc495e38545fcca8\"></p> <p align=\"center\"><strong>会&nbsp; 场</strong></p> <p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"migration-resource://401ba94bb27d7372c4a5d6e04ccbc6164f1a6190d28964ca08d8029e04abdc96\"></p> <p align=\"center\"><strong>各省座谈讨论</strong></p> <p align=\"center\"><img border=\"0\" src=\"migration-resource://fab13993e1901c063c1b77dc4af11195b586454638f6403fe35c8e4a3af03230\"></p> <p align=\"center\"><strong>全国高等学校学生信息咨询与就业指导中心处长方伟讲话</strong></p> <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p><strong></strong></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><strong></strong></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><strong></strong></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><strong></strong></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p> <p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: 33.75pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.5\" class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 13.5pt; mso-ascii-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-fareast-theme-font: major-fareast; mso-hansi-theme-font: major-fareast\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p><strong></strong></o:p></span></span>&nbsp;</p></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"xian2\">\n            </div>\n            <table width=\"100%\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td width=\"10%\" height=\"23\" bgcolor=\"#FFFFFF\" align=\"right\">\n                        附件：\n                    </td>\n        